    "title": "Solitaire Collection - 2024",
    "description": "The classic solitaire that you played on PC is now ready to be enjoyed on your phone!\r\n\r\nSolitaire, also known as Klondike/ Patience or Soli, is the most popular single player card games in the world. If you like classic Solitary, you're going to love this crisp and clear solitaire game for FREE, offline and online! Join over 10 million users playing our Solitaire Card Game today.\r\n\r\nAs a classic card game, Solitaire has countless card game lovers around the world. Do you still remember the first time when you open and play Solitaire? This is not only in your memory because Solitaire can be played now on phone and tablet, anywhere and anytime.\r\n\r\nDownload Solitaire today and play our fun card game \u2013 FREE!\r\n\r\n- Solitaire Card Games Features -\r\n\r\n+ Multiple language choices\r\n+ Can choose whether one or three cards are drawn from the deck at a time\r\n+ Can Choose playing by left hand or right hand\r\n+ Multiple choice backgrounds and cards with different face styles.\r\n+ Click & Draw function, when you click on one card, it can automatically move to the right place\r\n+ HINT can guide to move next\r\n+ Auto save incomplete game\r\n+ Unlimited UNDO\r\n+ Can be played offline, without wifi\r\n+ Upgrade and play with no Ads!\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you like classic, realistic and fun single player card games like Spider Solitaire, Pyramid Solitaire, FreeCell Solitaire, then Klondike Solitaire is for you!\r\n\r\nPlay the best FREE SOLITAIRE card game on Android now and see for yourself why so many others love this Solitaire game!",
